WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.945 --> 00:00:04.570
A big thing for reporters
to do in the news right now

00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:07.507
is find an empty area
and walk around, and say,

00:00:07.507 --> 00:00:11.440
"Look how empty it is,
'cause of the coronavirus."

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:15.110
They use phrases like,
"It's eerily quiet."

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:16.860
Well, I wanted to do my part,

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:19.380
so I'm walking around
this pretty empty street

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:22.140
to show you how empty it
is with the coronavirus.

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:23.730
[Camera Operator] It's always empty.

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:24.911
What do you mean, it's always empty?

00:00:24.911 --> 00:00:26.320
[Camera Operator] It's a deserted street.

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:27.450
It's a service road.

00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:28.459
It's a service road?

00:00:28.459 --> 00:00:29.292
[Camera Operator] Yes.

00:00:29.292 --> 00:00:30.310
So it's always this empty?

00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:31.143
[Camera Operator] Yes.

00:00:31.143 --> 00:00:32.580
Damn it.

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:33.880
Damn it to hell.

